{
  "bookId": "hero-211204",
  "id": "bond-27547",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27547001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "哇哦，为什么忽然送我这——么豪华的礼物！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没有特殊的理由，我想给萝贝卡一个家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "好耶！萝贝卡超喜欢这栋房子！\n让我给你一个大力的抱抱吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27547005",
              "text": "抱住她"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27547004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "|101|的怀里，很温暖呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "就这样再......多抱一会儿......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你哭了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "大、大惊小怪，我不是经常哭吗。\n而且每次哭得都比现在更大声！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这次和之前不一样。\n你在伤心吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "我记得很久之前，爸爸......还有洛瑞丝姐姐的拥抱，也是这么温暖。但后来......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27547012",
              "text": "他们抛弃了你。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27547012",
              "text": "没事的，都过去了。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27547011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "既然做了我的主人，在我长大之前，|101|要一直陪在我身边。\n说好了，不许反悔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但是，变成手办的萝贝卡已经不会再长大了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27547014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "嗯。所以就要永远和我在一起。\n不答应的话，我要闹了哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
